# The bus.* events of the parity sequence (TestParitySequenceEmitsTheGoldenBusEvents),
# recorded against bus.Supervisor before its lifecycle moved into workload.Process
# (docs/design/code-restructure-plan.md, Move 2, PR 2b). PR 2c asserts the same
# list from the driver. One kind per line, in ring order.

# A stale pidfile, and the port held by a process it does not prove.
bus.pidfile-stale
bus.pidfile-unproven

# A fresh start with a structural miss, on a hub with no leaf credential.
bus.unprovisioned
bus.started
bus.leaf.unenrolled

# A crash, and the respawn after the backoff.
bus.crashed
bus.started
bus.leaf.unenrolled

# A requested restart.
bus.started
bus.leaf.unenrolled

# A stop.
bus.stopped
